WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Two-way calendar sync. Connect Google Calendar or Outlook; tasks and events stay in step both ways.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: drag in your calendar.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Connect your calendar → Flow creates its own calendar → Edits sync both ways

4
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:20.870
(Note: A stand-in for Google approves the connection: the isolated test server never talks to real Google accounts.) Two-way calendar sync connects Google Calendar or Outlook.

5
00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:26.540
Connect, approve access…

6
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:31.330
…and Flow keeps a “Noirly Flow” calendar there in step with your tasks.

7
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:37.330
The connect buttons are missing: The server hasn't configured that calendar's credentials and CALENDAR_TOKEN_KEY. “Couldn't connect that calendar.”: The sign-in was cancelled or didn't start in Flow. Try Connect again.

8
00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:41.830
Google Calendar and Outlook
